    - target: {fileID: 5638779662825134770, guid: ace9b8c10851fde4781bd88fa6c4c4bd,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: "Objective Explanation\n\n\nThe project focuses on developing a Virtual
        Reality (VR) application for learning Philippine folk dances, particularly
        Lerion and Cari\xF1osa. Using 3D graphics, it provides an immersive and interactive
        environment where users can practice dance steps, receive feedback, and explore
        the cultural significance of these dances. The application will be evaluated
        based on the ISO/IEC 25010 model to ensure it adheres to established quality
        standards. By combining technology with cultural education, this VR application
        promotes the preservation of Filipino heritage and offers a modern approach
        to learning traditional dances."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
